[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810315893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104985#issuecomment-2810315893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104985","id":2810315893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nggR1","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T17:59:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T17:59:59Z","body":"Yeah, `StaticCString` would no longer be needed. At least after cleaning up surrounding functions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810315893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2813329566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104985#issuecomment-2813329566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104985","id":2813329566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nsACe","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-17T15:30:10Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T16:24:47Z","body":"> On second thought, we probably should tackle the StaticCString removal here too. I checked back on the core meeting discussion points I missed, and it mentioned this PR/proposal needing more justification—I'd say removal of the StaticCString paradigm & consequential simplification of StringName creation makes for a solid justification. \r\n\r\nI didn't at first, because I was afraid it would be a far more complex change. Turns out I just needed to search-and-replace `StaticCString::create` and `_scs_create` with `StringName` (and delete functions). Pretty simple!\r\n\r\n> Plus, we'd be able to ensure that the performance/size savings still apply; I have no reason to believe they would change, but making sure now is the better call\r\n\r\nI don't think it should affect persistent allocations, because `StaticCString` is a transient object that doesn't affect allocations.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I tested allocations again just to be sure, and found this time, this PR _decreased_ RAM usage by 3mb. I'm guessing at this point the difference might be general fluctuations, and it might be indicative that the change isn't large enough to measure.\r\n\r\nEdit: Here's a quick benchmark to show the difference in `String` conversions:\r\n```c++\r\n\tStringName s1 = \"_ready\";\r\n\tStringName s2 = \"Xready\";\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 100000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\tString s = s1;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 100000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\tString s = s2;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich prints on master: `3333ms 1402ms`\r\nIn this PR, they're both ~`1380ms`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2813329566/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824985933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104985#issuecomment-2824985933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104985","id":2824985933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oYd1N","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T17:11:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T17:11:56Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824985933/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]